  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="- Overview (用來檢查目前這個 BAPI User 是否有權限執行某項 SAP BAPI 操作，它是利用 SAP 標準的 AUTHORITY_CHECK 這個 Function Module 來做授權判斷。)&#xA;Check the BAPI execution Authority.&#xA;(Using SAP function module : AUTHORITY_CHECK)&#xA;&#xA;- Input/Output&#xA;in_SapConnection as SAP Connect Info  &lt;UiPath.SAP.BAPI.ConnectionService.IConnectionService&gt;&#xA;in_Import as BAPI Argument Import Data &lt;Dictionary&lt;String, Object&gt;&#xA;in_DataTable as BAPI Argument DataTable &lt;Dictionary&lt;String, DataTable&gt;&gt;&#xA;in_Option as Option Value &lt;Dictionary&lt;String, DataTable&gt;&gt;&#xA;out_Authority as  Result BAPI AuthorityCheck &lt;String&gt;" DisplayName="CheckAuthority" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="973,3290" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_3">
